## Approach

The Cert PT loop (rules in `petey/method.md`): warm-up (spaced review) → orient + guess → teach → fact card → explain it back → quiz (7 + 3 interleaved, with confidence ratings) → repair (→ `MissLog.md`) → close out. One session per tracker row, ~60-80 min, {{session_count}} sessions. Day-by-day dates: `ObjectiveTracker.md`.

